choose-if: spd_relation >= 40 and greens_relation >= 40
unavailable-subtitle: Our relations with the moderate left aren't good enough.
on-arrival: spd_relation += 1; greens_relation += 1; meckvor_groko = 0; meckvor_traffic_light = 0; meckvor_rot_rot_grun = 1; meckvor_jamaica = 0; meckvor_rot_rot = 0; meckvor_kenya = 0; meckvor_schwarz_blau = 0; meckvor_tigerenten = 0; meckvor_kiwi = 0; meckvor_die_linke_maj = 0; meckvor_afd_maj = 0; meckvor_rot_grun = 0; meckvor_spd_maj = 0; meckvor_green_maj = 0; meckvor_cdu_maj = 0; meckvor_weimar_but_different = 0; meckvor_red_purple = 0; meckvor_brombeer = 0; meckvor_querfront = 0;

We have formed a <span style="color: [+ linke_color +];">Red</span>-<span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">red</span>-<span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">green</span> coalition with the moderate left.

@red_purple
view-if: meckvor_pot_red_purple >= 50 and bsw_r_meckvor > 0
choose-if: bsw_relation >= 40
unavailable-subtitle: Our relations with Wagenknecht aren't good enough.
on-arrival: bsw_relation += 1; youth_linke -= 0.2; youth_greens += 0.2; meckvor_groko = 0; meckvor_traffic_light = 0; meckvor_rot_rot_grun = 0; meckvor_jamaica = 0; meckvor_rot_rot = 0; meckvor_kenya = 0; meckvor_schwarz_blau = 0; meckvor_tigerenten = 0; meckvor_kiwi = 0; meckvor_die_linke_maj = 0; meckvor_afd_maj = 0; meckvor_rot_grun = 0; meckvor_spd_maj = 0; meckvor_green_maj = 0; meckvor_cdu_maj = 0; meckvor_weimar_but_different = 0; meckvor_red_purple = 1; meckvor_brombeer = 0; meckvor_querfront = 0;

